@page
@model Portfolio.Pages.Skills.WebApiModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Web API / REST Services";
}

<h2>@ViewData["Title"]</h2>
<h3>@ViewData["Message"]</h3>

<div class="row pt-3">
    <div class="col-md-12">
        <h3>RESTful Service Design</h3>
        <p>
            API and integration work has been a consistent part of my career across enterprise systems, SaaS solutions, automation, and
            personal projects. My experience includes RESTful service development, service-to-service integration, and practical API usage
            in business workflows where reliability and clarity matter more than novelty.
        </p>
        <h3>Serverless and Integration Direction</h3>
        <p>
            Recent public starter work includes a dedicated C# API starter and a C# Azure Function starter, reflecting my current interest
            in creating reusable service foundations for teams. In prior work I also delivered integrations using SOAP and REST, including
            enterprise platform integrations and API-driven automation.
        </p>
        <h3>Operational Thinking</h3>
        <p>
            My API work is shaped by QA and support experience, so I naturally think about diagnostics, failure modes, testing, and clear
            operational behavior. The seq-mcp project extends that thinking into AI tooling by exposing a controlled service surface with
            structured error handling, validation, Docker packaging, and observability-minded usage.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <ul class="list-group">
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">RESTful API design</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">Azure Function application direction</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">Service-to-service integration</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">SOAP and REST experience</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">Structured error handling</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">API diagnostics and observability</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">Automation and API testing</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">Reusable starter architecture</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <h3>External Links</h3>
        <a class="btn btn-info btn-site" href="https://github.com/AGameEmpowerment/Starter-CSharp-Api" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Starter-CSharp-Api &gt;&gt;</a><br />
        <a class="btn btn-info btn-site" href="https://github.com/AGameEmpowerment/Starter-CSharp-Azure-Function-App" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Starter-CSharp-Azure-Function-App &gt;&gt;</a><br />
        <a class="btn btn-info btn-site" href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/seq-mcp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">seq-mcp &gt;&gt;</a><br />
        <a class="btn btn-info btn-site" href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/DotNetProjectStartup" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DotNetProjectStartup &gt;&gt;</a><br />
    </div>
</div>
